---
description: Repository startup and canonical agent skill routing.
alwaysApply: true
---

Run `.agentic-template/bin/project startup` first, or read `AGENTS.md` from
disk yourself. Confirm that `AGENTS.md` was read from disk, then review the
startup sequence and options before choosing the next command.

`AGENTS.md` is the canonical operating contract. For non-trivial work, read
`HANDOFF.toon`, `PROJECT_PROFILE.toon` and `.agents/knowledge/index.md` before
planning or implementation.

Canonical repository skills live under `.agents/skills/` and are indexed by
`.agents/skills/CATALOG.toon`. Load only the relevant `.agents/skills/.../SKILL.md`
files for the task instead of copying or symlinking the full skill tree into
Cursor rules.
